<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank 1996 group net profit up 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank 1996 group net profit up 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996</p>
<p>(billions of Belgian francs, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)	  13.11 vs     11.55</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 265  vs     235</p>
<p>Note - Kredietbank NV said that its board had decided to give shareholders the choice whether they want their dividend to be paid in cash or in shares.</p>
</text>
